{"id":"u04","level":"A1","emoji":"🍽️","title":{"t":"Food and drink","s":"غذا و نوشیدنی","a":"audio/en-fa/764f4df0c075.mp3"},"goals":["اسم چند غذا و نوشیدنی را بگویم.","a، an و some را درست به‌کار ببرم.","بگویم چه چیزی را دوست دارم و چه چیزی را دوست ندارم.","مؤدبانه چیزی بخواهم: I'd like …, please."],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"bread","s":"نان","pr":"برِد","emoji":"🍞","ex":{"t":"I like bread and cheese.","s":"من نان و پنیر دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/78d375aac90d.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f35e.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/bfed01f394f2.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"rice","s":"برنج","pr":"رایس","emoji":"🍚","ex":{"t":"I'd like some rice, please.","s":"لطفاً کمی برنج می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/7e543edb3b76.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f35a.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/576e605c68e1.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"tea","s":"چای","pr":"تی","emoji":"🍵","ex":{"t":"We like tea.","s":"ما چای دوست داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/56deaee4367d.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f375.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/f9d72a60dee9.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"coffee","s":"قهوه","pr":"کافی","emoji":"☕","ex":{"t":"I don't like coffee.","s":"من قهوه دوست ندارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/fa13b646ed1c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/2615.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/fde5c6024928.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"water","s":"آب","pr":"واتِر","emoji":"💧","ex":{"t":"Some water, please.","s":"کمی آب، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/bc36ee754b3b.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4a7.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/b8075c8895f9.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"milk","s":"شیر","pr":"میلک","emoji":"🥛","ex":{"t":"We have some milk.","s":"ما کمی شیر داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/eef2f2808bc8.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f95b.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/5b240953e9ec.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"juice","s":"آبمیوه","pr":"جوس","emoji":"🧃","ex":{"t":"I'd like an orange juice, please.","s":"لطفاً یک آب‌پرتقال می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/07cc24dad43c.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9c3.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/ec71a8680ff9.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"egg","pl":"eggs","s":"تخم‌مرغ","pr":"اِگ","emoji":"🥚","ex":{"t":"I'd like two eggs, please.","s":"لطفاً دو تا تخم‌مرغ می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/d933af18b124.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f95a.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/d49bb7f9fd43.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/69d94766895e.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"cheese","s":"پنیر","pr":"چیز","emoji":"🧀","ex":{"t":"Do you like cheese?","s":"پنیر دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/3510ae15272e.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f9c0.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/5fa83474fcc4.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"chicken","s":"مرغ (گوشت مرغ)","pr":"چیکِن","emoji":"🍗","ex":{"t":"We like chicken and rice.","s":"ما مرغ و برنج دوست داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/2e8ced3cecac.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f357.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/e28a6678cad3.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"apple","pl":"apples","s":"سیب","pr":"اَپِل","emoji":"🍎","ex":{"t":"An apple, please.","s":"یک سیب، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/54c03f368b40.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34e.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/92693776e2e8.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/8a1baeffb46e.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"orange","pl":"oranges","s":"پرتقال","pr":"اُرِنج","emoji":"🍊","ex":{"t":"I have an orange.","s":"من یک پرتقال دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/61a7644682a5.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34a.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/072248cac992.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/09f17ce64102.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"banana","pl":"bananas","s":"موز","pr":"بِنَنا","emoji":"🍌","ex":{"t":"They like bananas.","s":"آن‌ها موز دوست دارند.","a":"audio/en-fa/874e9ecc73ca.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f34c.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/44fd898bd4bd.mp3","pla":"audio/en-fa/92499ccf48e1.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"breakfast","s":"صبحانه","pr":"برِکفِست","emoji":"🍳","ex":{"t":"We have bread and cheese for breakfast.","s":"ما صبحانه نان و پنیر می‌خوریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/cece6df9db88.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f373.svg","a":"audio/en-fa/419997cc4d62.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"I'd like …, please.","s":"لطفاً … می‌خواهم.","pr":"آید لایک …، پلیز.","a":"audio/en-fa/55ce07252452.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Would you like some tea?","s":"چای میل دارید؟","pr":"وود یو لایک سام تی؟","a":"audio/en-fa/0a284247d7f9.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Do you like …?","s":"… دوست داری؟","pr":"دو یو لایک …؟","a":"audio/en-fa/3dc117d0092a.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Yes, I do. / No, I don't.","s":"بله، دوست دارم. / نه، دوست ندارم.","pr":"یِس، آی دو. / نُو، آی دُونت.","a":"audio/en-fa/82479d66ba2b.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","pr":"هیر یو آر.","a":"audio/en-fa/7f965ecd5ac9.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"I'm hungry.","s":"گرسنه‌ام.","pr":"آیم هانگری.","a":"audio/en-fa/06b1341086b7.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"It's delicious!","s":"خیلی خوشمزه است!","pr":"ایتس دیلیشِس!","a":"audio/en-fa/36032771b066.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Enjoy your meal!","s":"نوش جان!","pr":"اِنجُی یور میل!","a":"audio/en-fa/5ff765c09b93.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"At Maryam's house","s":"در خانهٔ مریم","a":"audio/en-fa/b69c8b76e8ee.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Maryam","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Tom","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Hello, Tom! Would you like some tea?","s":"سلام تام! چای میل داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/c49f95d9c855.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, please. I like tea.","s":"بله، لطفاً. من چای دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/49b448ce9c3e.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرما.","a":"audio/en-fa/7f965ecd5ac9.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Thank you!","s":"ممنون!","a":"audio/en-fa/ea33391d54ba.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Are you hungry?","s":"گرسنه هستی؟","a":"audio/en-fa/f4afd0b24b9a.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, I am.","s":"بله، گرسنه‌ام.","a":"audio/en-fa/59db4e310f3e.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"We have rice and chicken. Do you like chicken?","s":"برنج و مرغ داریم. مرغ دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/f59e335bd5f9.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Yes, I do! I'd like some rice and chicken, please.","s":"بله، دوست دارم! لطفاً کمی برنج و مرغ می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/248b6bef0a8b.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Enjoy your meal!","s":"نوش جان!","a":"audio/en-fa/5ff765c09b93.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Mmm, it's delicious!","s":"به‌به، خیلی خوشمزه است!","a":"audio/en-fa/d6221c1a9b3b.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"a / an / some","s":"a، an و some"},"explain":"**a** و **an** یعنی «یک» و قبل از اسمِ مفرد می‌آیند.\nاگر کلمهٔ بعدی با صدای صدادار (مثل a، e، i، o) شروع شود، **an** می‌گوییم: **an** apple، **an** egg، **an** orange. بقیه با **a** می‌آیند: **a** banana، **a** son.\nبعضی چیزها شمردنی نیستند، مثل water، tea، rice و milk. با آن‌ها **a** نمی‌گوییم، بلکه **some** (کمی، مقداری): **some** water، **some** rice.\nبا اسم جمع هم **some** می‌آید: **some** apples (چند سیب).","table":[["a","a banana","a son"],["an","an apple","an egg"],["some","some water","some apples"]],"examples":[{"t":"I'd like an apple.","s":"یک سیب می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/9a06bb25c262.mp3"},{"t":"Ali has a banana.","s":"علی یک موز دارد.","a":"audio/en-fa/2b6825bcb3cc.mp3"},{"t":"We have some bread.","s":"ما کمی نان داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/dfc02b80bbfb.mp3"},{"t":"Some eggs, please.","s":"چند تا تخم‌مرغ، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/16b3edd7809f.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"I'd like ___ egg, please.","options":["a","an"],"answer":1,"s":"لطفاً یک تخم‌مرغ می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like an egg, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/9130cb5e22e9.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Ali has ___ banana.","options":["a","an"],"answer":0,"s":"علی یک موز دارد.","full":"Ali has a banana.","a":"audio/en-fa/2b6825bcb3cc.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"We have ___ water.","options":["a","an","some"],"answer":2,"s":"ما کمی آب داریم.","full":"We have some water.","a":"audio/en-fa/a53c27966738.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Sara has ___ orange.","options":["a","an"],"answer":1,"s":"سارا یک پرتقال دارد.","full":"Sara has an orange.","a":"audio/en-fa/a7682eb79581.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"This is ___ apple.","answer":["an"],"s":"این یک سیب است.","full":"This is an apple.","a":"audio/en-fa/ea182375affe.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"I'd like ___ rice, please.","answer":["some"],"s":"لطفاً کمی برنج می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like some rice, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/7e543edb3b76.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"I'd like an orange, please.","s":"لطفاً یک پرتقال می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like an orange, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/b26b9ad13d48.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"We have some bread.","s":"ما کمی نان داریم.","full":"We have some bread.","a":"audio/en-fa/dfc02b80bbfb.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"I like / I don't like / I'd like","s":"دوست دارم، دوست ندارم، می‌خواهم"},"explain":"برای گفتن چیزی که دوست داریم از **like** استفاده می‌کنیم: I **like** tea. (چای دوست دارم.)\nبرای منفی، قبل از like کلمهٔ **don't** می‌آید: I **don't like** coffee. (قهوه دوست ندارم.)\nبرای سؤال، **Do** را اول جمله می‌گذاریم: **Do you like** rice? جواب کوتاه: **Yes, I do.** یا **No, I don't.**\n**I'd like** (شکل کوتاه I would like) یعنی «می‌خواهم» یا «میل دارم». این جمله مؤدبانه است و برای سفارش و درخواست به‌کار می‌رود: I'd like some water, please.\nنکته: وقتی به‌طور کلی دربارهٔ چیزی شمردنی حرف می‌زنیم، آن را جمع می‌بندیم: I like apple**s**.","table":[["I like tea.","I don't like tea."],["We like rice.","We don't like rice."],["Do you like tea?","Yes, I do. / No, I don't."]],"examples":[{"t":"I like bananas.","s":"من موز دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/4b97fc11ce8c.mp3"},{"t":"We don't like coffee.","s":"ما قهوه دوست نداریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/2b9cb24c6621.mp3"},{"t":"Do you like cheese? — Yes, I do.","s":"پنیر دوست داری؟ — بله، دوست دارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/8fd0b31b3bf3.mp3"},{"t":"I'd like some tea, please.","s":"لطفاً کمی چای می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/53a0e8e35334.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"I ___ like fish.","options":["don't","not","no"],"answer":0,"s":"من ماهی دوست ندارم.","full":"I don't like fish.","a":"audio/en-fa/233efe2bcb03.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Do you like eggs? — Yes, I ___.","options":["do","like","am"],"answer":0,"s":"تخم‌مرغ دوست داری؟ — بله، دوست دارم.","full":"Do you like eggs? — Yes, I do.","a":"audio/en-fa/5e2a8327d024.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"___ like a coffee, please.","options":["I'd","I'm","I"],"answer":0,"s":"لطفاً یک قهوه می‌خواهم.","full":"I'd like a coffee, please.","a":"audio/en-fa/3fe451724e52.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"I like ___.","options":["apple","apples"],"answer":1,"s":"من سیب دوست دارم.","full":"I like apples.","a":"audio/en-fa/95b50d93fd7f.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"We ___ like milk.","answer":["don't","don’t","do not"],"s":"ما شیر دوست نداریم.","full":"We don't like milk.","a":"audio/en-fa/654f30355855.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"___ you like tea?","answer":["Do"],"s":"چای دوست داری؟","full":"Do you like tea?","a":"audio/en-fa/5d3242330908.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"I don't like coffee.","s":"من قهوه دوست ندارم.","full":"I don't like coffee.","a":"audio/en-fa/fa13b646ed1c.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Do you like chicken?","s":"مرغ دوست داری؟","full":"Do you like chicken?","a":"audio/en-fa/0a0828e7dec3.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Breakfast with Neda","s":"صبحانه با ندا","a":"audio/en-fa/1d00605dbb65.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"My name is Neda, and I'm from Iran.","s":"اسم من ندا است و اهل ایران هستم.","a":"audio/en-fa/5c9a82f5b5f1.mp3"},{"t":"I like breakfast!","s":"من صبحانه را دوست دارم!","a":"audio/en-fa/6cc6c3780aa5.mp3"},{"t":"We have bread, cheese, and tea for breakfast.","s":"ما صبحانه نان، پنیر و چای می‌خوریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/3a54388d3213.mp3"},{"t":"I like tea. I don't like coffee.","s":"من چای دوست دارم. قهوه دوست ندارم.","a":"audio/en-fa/8bbf920c0b7f.mp3"},{"t":"My brother Amir and I like eggs.","s":"من و برادرم امیر تخم‌مرغ دوست داریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/cae916b5e050.mp3"},{"t":"My mother has an apple and some milk.","s":"مادرم یک سیب و کمی شیر می‌خورد.","a":"audio/en-fa/afb07a8bfdcc.mp3"},{"t":"Do you like breakfast, too?","s":"تو هم صبحانه دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/2501d1d55c09.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"What do they have for breakfast?","s":"آن‌ها صبحانه چه می‌خورند؟","a":"audio/en-fa/2c54c4ef1932.mp3"},"options":["bread, cheese, and tea","rice and chicken","orange juice"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Who has an apple?","s":"چه کسی یک سیب می‌خورد؟","a":"audio/en-fa/00755b9a87e9.mp3"},"options":["Neda's mother","Neda's brother","Neda's sister"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Do Neda and Amir like eggs?","s":"آیا ندا و امیر تخم‌مرغ دوست دارند؟","a":"audio/en-fa/21fcca134aca.mp3"},"options":["Yes, they do.","No, they don't."],"answer":0}]},"sentences":[{"t":"I'd like some water, please.","s":"لطفاً کمی آب می‌خواهم.","a":"audio/en-fa/7fb403efa7e0.mp3"},{"t":"Do you like rice?","s":"برنج دوست داری؟","a":"audio/en-fa/f669325bdb76.mp3"},{"t":"We don't like coffee.","s":"ما قهوه دوست نداریم.","a":"audio/en-fa/2b9cb24c6621.mp3"},{"t":"Here you are.","s":"بفرمایید.","a":"audio/en-fa/7f965ecd5ac9.mp3"},{"t":"An egg and some bread, please.","s":"یک تخم‌مرغ و کمی نان، لطفاً.","a":"audio/en-fa/e4b2d6d76c90.mp3"},{"t":"They like oranges and bananas.","s":"آن‌ها پرتقال و موز دوست دارند.","a":"audio/en-fa/3d6345120c9c.mp3"},{"t":"Enjoy your meal!","s":"نوش جان!","a":"audio/en-fa/5ff765c09b93.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f37d.svg"}